   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Krishantering Estland</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Major incident Estonia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r projektet &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra den estniska polisens m&#xf6;jlighet att p&#xe5; ett effektivt s&#xe4;tt hantera st&#xf6;rre  krissituationer och d&#xe4;rmed f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra skyddet av medborgarna i hela landet.Projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att de estniska parterna ska f&#xe5; en &#xf6;kad kompetens att p&#xe5; egen hand organisera och driva krishantering p&#xe5; nationell niv&#xe5;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The cooperation between Sweden and Estonia regarding Major Incident Management crime prevention is aimed at ensuring that operational police units are prepared to deal effectively with major incidents in order to protect the safety and security of the public. The objective of the project is thus to increase the capability of major incident management consistent with contemporary standards of policing.</narrative>
  </description>
